### 2. What You Can Deduct (Above-the-Line & Business)
Even if you take the standard deduction, you can still claim certain "above-the-line" deductions and business expenses:

*   **Student Loan Interest:** You paid $2,700, but the IRS caps the student loan interest deduction at **$2,500** per return. Based on your estimated income (~$75k), you are well below the phase-out limit, so you can deduct the full $2,500 directly from your taxable inc

  Chunk 5/10 (512 chars):
